		<sortname>0028 =-  Barnsley Badger</sortname>
		<desc>In this game inspired by the Monty Mole series you play Barnsley, a lazy, good for nothing badger whose addiction to gambling has got him into all sorts of trouble. One night in his local boozer he overhears a conversation. A gold coin was discovered in the nearby graveyard, a coin carved with the head of the fabled ruler Tutanbodger on one side. If Barnsley can find the lost treasure of Tutanbodger it would solve all his money problems.  A great journey awaits - as long as he doesn't fall asleep on the way!</desc>
