		<sortname>0423 =-  Camelot Warriors</sortname>
		<desc>If you dare to cross the threshold of mystery, forget everything that you know, because you will go into in a trip without return. Past and future worlds, black magic, hidden traps - take your sword with a lot of courage and never throw a glance back. Four elements from the 20th century have entered the world of Camelot: "The voice of another world", "Wisdom mirror", "The life elixir" and "The fire that doesn't burn". You must take them and present them to the guardians of each world, who will be in charge of their destruction. Camelot Warriors is an action game with platforming elements. You must travel through four different worlds populated by many enemies. Forests, lakes, caverns and finally, the Castle of Camelot are awaiting you.</desc>
