		<mode>Single-player</mode>
		<desc>In this game, you are a private detective hired by Sue Ellen to find a map to hidden oil fields in the hope of amassing enough wealth to escape J.R.'s sinister influence. Sue Ellen offers you a reward of 2 million dollars for the map. You snoop around the grounds of South Fork Ranch, superficially interacting with popular characters from the television series and a number of extras from the animal kingdom. You have to stay out of the way of J.R., who wants to foil Sue Ellen's plans. So far, so good.
Your journey eventually takes you to the jungle around Playa Peligro in South America, where you overcome a series of obstacles using a variety of techniques, but most importantly by drugging a friendly monkey with tobacco...</desc>
