		<desc>Fight your way through the castle of Kyros, the Great Satan. And free the ones he holds captive behind mysterious mirrors. Smash the mirrors to break Kyros' evil spell and upon completing your quest, transform into the invincible MACHOMAN and desolate all in your path. An okay Gauntlet/Commando style game with lots of extras.</desc>
