		<desc>Destroyer is a naval combat simulation computer game released by Epyx in 1986. It was published for the Amiga, Apple II, Commodore 64, and IBM PC.
Players take the role of a captain controlling a United States Navy Destroyer class vessel. During World War II, the player has to command several Destroyer operations:
Subhunter missions
Rescue missions
Blockade runnings
Bombardment missions
Scout operations
