		<path>./3-average/Seaside Special.crt</path>
		<name>Seaside Special</name>
		<sortname>1677 =-  Seaside Special</sortname>
		<desc>The Polytikians have invaded the Earth and taken over the Tory Cabinet in 10 Downing Street. Only one man can stop them: Radium Rodney. To save the Earth, Rodney must collect radioactive seaweed from Rotaway Beach, then travel to 10 Downing Street to throw the weed at the fake politicians.
The game is played over two screens.
On the seaside screen, Rodney must collect 10 pieces of weed to continue. Trying to stop him is a guard with a gun and a jellyfish. Spending too much time in the irradiated sea or handling the seaweed is dangerous and can kill Rodney.
Once the 10 pieces are collected it's off to 10 Downing Street to stop the aliens. Rodney stands underneath the windows and when a politician appears he must throw seaweed at them while dodging various objects thrown back. After each politician is hit five times, Maggie Thatcher appears who also needs to be hit five times.</desc>
