		<desc>A game where the aim is to absorb your opponent's energy through targeted jumps in order to be able to jump even higher. You win a level either by knocking all enemies off the screen with skillful jumps, or by reaching maximum energy yourself and being able to leave the screen in the same direction, regardless of how many enemies are left.</desc>
