		<name>Darkland</name>
		<sortname>2172 =-  Darkland</sortname>
		<desc>Not to be confused with 1989's Darkland: The Last Realm, this game is a SEUCK shooter with pseudo Lovecraftian horror elements made by legendary SEUCK developer Alf Yngve and published by TND in 2015.
