		<name>Denniffia</name>
		<sortname>2192 =-  Denniffia</sortname>
		<desc>A great looking space shoot-em-up that features some special bonuses which you can obtain by picking up certain letters dropped by destroyed enemies. S gives a protective shield which will protect you for a short period against enemy fire. P gives you extra power rockets which can be fired by pressing space and V which gives you some extra velocity to avoid enemies more easily. I grants limited immortality so you can destroy enemies by ramming them. ? gives you an unknown bonus which varies over time.
The game was developed by the teams at Electric Brains Production, as well as New Entry.
Coding: Michal Bacík
Graphics: Nikaj Eijk
Sound/Music: Kristian Røstøen, Glenn Rune Gallefoss, and Kjell Nordbø
 Published in 64'er 1996/08.</desc>
