		<sortname>2436 =-  Iketa</sortname>
		<desc>Iketa is a one-on-one fighting game. It offers both a two-player mode, and a one-player mode with several difficulty levels. In the one-player mode, the player faces a progression of enemies, all of whom are ninjas wearing variously colored outfits. The player must win two rounds in each fight to move on to the next opponent. There are a number of moves available, such as a high kick or a jumping kick. Each battle lasts a maximum of 80 seconds; if the timer runs out, the game is over. Released in Magic Disk 64 1994/12.</desc>
