		<thumbnail>./media/thumbnails/Java Jim in Square Shaped Trouble-01.png</thumbnail>
		<marquee>./media/marquee/Java Jim... In Square Shaped Trouble.png</marquee>
		<video>./media/videos/Java Jim in Square Shaped Trouble.mp4</video>
		<boxback>./media/boxback/Java Jim in Square Shaped Trouble-01.jpg</boxback>
