		<desc>A platform game originally released by Konami for MSX in 1985. The game plays like Lode Runner, but takes place in Egyptian pyramids instead of ruins. As an intrepid adventurer, the player's goal is to collect various gems, while evading angry mummies and other monsters long enough to find the exit to the next level.  A total of 15 pyramids await us to discover. We can use pickaxes and swords against mummies.
This is an unofficial fanmade conversion for the C64</desc>
