		<desc>Box excerpt: REVS+ is, simply, the most advanced race simulator yet. Both car and circuit are painstakingly modelled on the real thing - down to details such as the lie of the land at both SILVERSTONE and BRAND'S HATCH. Compete against your friends or on your own against the computer-controlled cars. Name your own competitors; compete against their skill; make your own adjustments to the aerodynamics of your car; master the finger-tip controls to increase your skills in hours of enjoyment. Enjoy the sights, sounds and spills of real racing</desc>
