		<desc>Roller Coaster Rumbler is a rail shooter-type video game. It was designed by Subway Software (Arnie Katz, Bill Kunkel and Joyce Worley) for British publisher Tynesoft, which published it in 1989. Versions appeared on the PC, Amiga, Atari ST and Commodore 64 with quality varying greatly among the SKUs.
