Skærmtrolden Hugo was released for the Commodore 64 in 1991, and for the Amiga shortly afterwards. The game took place in a gold mine, which Hugo had to navigate to collect treasure. The game mechanics were simple and a complete game could take less than ten minutes.</desc>
