Sky High Stuntman is a top-down vertically scrolling shoot-em-up. The joystick or keyboard is used to steer while flying the helicopter, bi-plane and jet fighter. The fire button or space bar fire your weapon. Flying the balloon you use the joystick or keyboard to move a sight and shoot the enemy. Moving the sight so far will move the balloon in that direction. Fire button or space bar will fire your weapon.</desc>
