		<path>./5-verylow/Blue Powder Grey Smoke.zip</path>
		<name>Blue Powder Grey Smoke</name>
		<sortname>3277 =-  Blue Powder Grey Smoke</sortname>
		<desc>Blue Powder Grey Smoke is a strategy war game based upon the American Civil War.
1-player versus computer or 2-player strategy game played in semi-real time. The player can choose from a number of historical and non-historical missions, from either the Confederate or Union perspective. In the non-historical setting, the positioning of troops and the characteristics of reinforcements are randomized, so as to not represent the original battle conditions. Gameplay uses a number of historically accurate types of arms. During play, the player can move between 3 different zoom levels to monitor the action of their troops in realtime, but the action can be paused at any time to issue commands. Commands are issued via a menu system, and the player can choose objectives for their individual troops, as well as the speed, offensive, and defensive positions they wish them to take.</desc>
		<rating>0.30</rating>
