		<desc>A German language action game created by Gerrit Knoef and published in Input 64 1987/10. The pinball rockets into the maze and you must guide it towards all the numbers or letters by controlling the gates and where they direct the ball. To win the level you must hit all the numbers or letters in order and exit the maze. In some levels you must also avoid wandering monsters.</desc>
