		<name>Combots</name>
		<sortname>3360 =-  Combots</sortname>
		<desc>In 2005, aliens landed and launched a campaign of global domination. Their pulse signal destroyed and neutralized nuclear weapons stockpiles and eliminated most forms of communication between continents and nations. We were isolated, but we fought back. The aliens came in armored machines that could walk and fly, but the humans built their own out of scrap iron and spare parts. From captured alien robots, we learned their technological secrets to wage war against the aliens.
This is a strategy based fighting game with big robots. The battle takes place on a hexagonal map with different terrains. Gameplay is turn-based, with the player and computer troops taking turns moving troops.</desc>
