		<name>Curse, The</name>
		<sortname>3388 =-  Curse, The</sortname>
		<desc>The Curse is a single player text adventure. The game is set in ancient Egypt. The player takes the role of someone who has visited a travelling fair and entered a fortune teller's tent. Looking into the fortune tellers crystal the player is transported to another world and from there they must find a way back. Along the way the player's score / progress is recorded as a percentage, the maximum score at the end of the game is 100%.</desc>
