		<path>./5-verylow/Defender (64'er).crt</path>
		<name>Defender (Magna Media)</name>
		<sortname>3421 =-  Defender (Magna Media)</sortname>
		<desc>A variation of Space Invaders (not Defender)  that was released by Magna Media/64'er in 1994, and coded by Jan Zimmerman. It differs in Space Invaders in several ways, one of which is power-ups. During the game large colored balls falls from the sky and land on the ground (if they don't land on you first) These balls represent several power-ups
red ball =  higher shot frequency
violet ball = double shot power
green ball = super shot
blue ball = slower energy-downcounter
orange ball = destroys all aliens currently on the screen
brown ball = builds up wall/barrier
light-blue ball = faster shot
light-red ball = takes away wall</desc>
		<rating>0.70</rating>
