		<desc>You are being held prisoner on Devil's Island and you plan to escape from your cell and the prison itself. If you make it away from the prison, you then have to get through a jungle before getting off the island to the mainland. Devil's Island is a text adventure where the screen describe each location you visit and you type in commands with the keyboard to interact with your surroundings.</desc>
