	<game id="112204">
		<path>./5-verylow/Frankie Crashed on Jupiter.d81</path>
		<name>Frankie Crashed on Jupiter</name>
		<sortname>3509 =-  Frankie Crashed on Jupiter</sortname>
		<desc>Frankie Crashed on Jupiter is an English-language, somewhat bizarre text / graphic adventure. As the name of the game suggests, a certain spaceship called Frankie (according to the cover picture) builds a crash landing on Jupiter. If it were not Jupiter, you could still call that "normal," but Jupiter is a gas giant. But what you then have to gather together in the spaceship and build in order to get a codeword falls under "slightly off-hook". Curious? Just play through, then you know it too ...</desc>
