	<game id="112535">
		<path>./5-verylow/Gamma Force - The Pit of a Thousand Screams.d81</path>
		<name>Gamma Force - The Pit of a Thousand Screams</name>
		<sortname>3514 =-  Gamma Force - The Pit of a Thousand Screams</sortname>
		<desc>In a dangerous world, individual superheroes are not enough. Even the best of them - a humanoid made of flames, an elf princess with a mean bow, and a muscle-bound aquatic beast - can't do everything alone. When they come together, they are the gamma force. Can anyone stop them?
Gameplay essentially consists of choices that break up the viewing of the game's cartoon-like scenes and advance the story in different ways depending on the player's choices. The player can also switch different characters' points of view, gaining more insight into the narrative.</desc>
