		<desc>Millions of adults and children have enjoyed playing the board game and now the ultimate Mastermind can be played on your own computer. Test your logic and skill against the Computer MASTERMIND Program. Break the hidden code of shapes, colours or numbers in the world famous game. Enjoy hours of high-quality entertainment in full colour and sound playing the virtually endless variations available.</desc>
