		<desc>You're the writer, director on the set Starring far-out flikniks, the Jazz Scats: Swivel Hips, Wahoo and Mr. Bassman! With movie Musical Madness, you set the scene, you choose the stars and you compose the musical score. And no two movies ever have to be the can take your "cameras" to the city, to the jungle, even into outer space. Choose from Choose from an endless combination of props and sets to inspire new and creative movies each time you yell, "Action!". 
