		<sortname>3771 =-  Number Nabber Shape Grabber</sortname>
		<desc>Two learning games in one convenient cartridge. Once your children grab hold of these games, they'll play 'em for years. NUMBER NABBER builds arithmetic skills, while SHAPE GRABBER develops the young child's ability to identify a variety of shapes. Both games come with music and sound effects so lively, you'll find yourself grabbing for a chance to play a few rounds.</desc>
