		<sortname>3808 =-  Peanuts Maze Marathon</sortname>
		<desc>Peanuts Maze Marathon is a simple puzzle game designed for children 4-8. The game features characters from Charles Shulz's Peanuts who, for one reason or another, need to get from one location to their destination. In between the locations is a randomly generated maze players need to solve in order to help out the characters; once players successfully guide a dot through the maze to the exit, a short animation is shown. Players can optionally select a time limit for completing each maze; default values of 4, 3, or 2 minutes are provided, or players can enter in the number of seconds or minutes they would like.</desc>
