		<desc>You are a pioneer railwayman in charge of building a line in the American West between Base City and  Junction  City. It's  your job to hire and fire  surveyors, workers and  guards to  protect you  and  your workforce against  marauding bandits. By  building stations along the route, you can generate income to pay your 'workforce and buy additional stock should you require it. To thwart your efforts,  warlike Indians try  to  disrupt your work by  killing members of  the workforce and ripping up the track. Your only hope is that the cavalry from Fort Commodore can get to the Indians before they get to you. A game for budding pioneersmen everywhere.</desc>
