Find the key for the secret door in the west hall and place it on the podium in the pool room. Secret keys and signs will guide your way. Only with wisdom, skill and judgement will you be able to return to your former life. It will be tough, there are 20 chambers to explore and only 3 lives to do it with.</desc>
