		<thumbnail>./media/thumbnails/Star Fleet I_ The War Begins!-01.png</thumbnail>
		<marquee>./media/marquee/Star Fleet I_ The War Begins!.png</marquee>
		<video>./media/videos/Star Fleet I - The War Begins!.mp4</video>
		<boxback>./media/boxback/Star Fleet I_ The War Begins!-01.jpg</boxback>
