		<desc>Fanatics have captured the building in which the destructive Doomsday device is stored, and have set it to explode. This gives you 25 minutes to reach the building and destroy it.
Viewed from the cockpit of your vehicle, Omega Run is a 3D shoot 'em up cum flight simulator. Your cockpit dials include a timer, altimeter, damage report and a long-range scanner. Enemy mounted laser beams and anti-aircraft fire must be dodged, while re-fuelling is required mid-game The game can be customised in may ways to fine tune the exact difficulty.</desc>
