		<desc>Try your luck at mastering trivia  questions from  five separate categories including:  sports,  music,  TV, science and general.  Race against the clock  to choose your favorite trivia subject.  Questions come onto the screen accompanied by a  set of multiple choice answers,  or you  may opt to input your own response.And when you have become an expert in this challeng-ing game of trivia,  Screenplay offers The Trivia Arcade Question Pack 2, which tests your skills on subjects ranging from history to comics.</desc>
