		<name>720 Degrees (European Version)</name>
		<desc>A simulation with so many extras it's almost not a simulation. The 80s promised to make skaters of us all, but somehow it never quite happened - if you miss your cheap old board, try this one for size, if not.... On yer bike!...</desc>
